Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if selective weighting improves over best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination over the stable pool1 using the pre‑computed pooled_meta_model weights (w1) to see if a learned weighting beats the best_single DWT_rf.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","ONLY_DWT_rf"],"weights":"w1"}

Thought: Try a trimmed‑mean over pool4 (5 models) with 20% trimming to see if selective averaging beats the current weighted w2 result.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

