Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a simple median over pool4 to see if a selective median beats the best_single and trimmed_mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test DBA on pool3 to see if a more selective weighted scheme improves over best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

